[INFO] Available backups:

   1) 20260115_160000 - 2026-01-15 16:00:00 PST [LATEST]
   2) 20260115_150000 - 2026-01-15 15:00:00 PST
   3) 20260115_143022 - 2026-01-15 14:30:22 PST

Select backup number (or 'q' to quit): 1

[INFO] Backup Details:
Config Backup Manifest
======================
