## Configuration Types

### Claude Desktop Config

**Location:** `bootstrap/[pc-name]/configs/claude-desktop/`

**Files:**
- `claude_desktop_config.json` - Claude Desktop app settings
- `custom_instructions.txt` - Custom AI instructions

**When to update:**
- After changing Claude Desktop settings
- After modifying MCP server configurations
- After updating API keys or endpoints

### Docker Compose Files

**Locations:**
- `bootstrap/[pc-name]/docker/docker-compose.yml` - PC-specific services
- Root: `docker-compose.yml`, `docker-compose.infisical.yml`

**When to update:**
- After adding/removing services
- After changing port mappings
- After updating environment variables
- After modifying volume mounts

### MCP Server Config

**Locations:**
- `.mcp.json` - Root MCP configuration
- `.claude-flow/mcp.json` - Claude Flow MCP settings

**When to update:**
- After adding new MCP servers
- After changing server commands/args
- After updating environment variables
- After modifying server settings

### Tailscale/Cloudflared Settings

**Location:** `bootstrap/[pc-name]/configs/`

**Files:**
- Tailscale auth keys
- Cloudflared tunnel configs
- Network routing rules

**When to update:**
- After joining new Tailscale network
- After creating new Cloudflared tunnel
- After changing network configuration

### Gitea Configurations

**Location:** `bootstrap/orchestrator-mini/wsl/gitea/`

**Files:**
- `docker-compose.yml` - Gitea service config
- `app.ini` - Gitea application settings

**When to update:**
- After changing Gitea settings
- After updating authentication methods
- After modifying repository settings

### Infisical Paths

**Location:** Various `.env` files and configs

**Files:**
- `.env` files with Infisical project IDs
- Config files with Infisical secret paths

**When to update:**
- After rotating secrets
- After changing Infisical projects
- After updating secret paths

