## Configuration File Reference

### Backup Script Options

Modify these variables in `backup-configs.sh`:

```bash
# PC directories to backup
PC_DIRS=(
    "orchestrator-mini"
    "worker-rtx3060"
    "worker-rtx3090ti"
    "worker-rtx5090"
)

# File patterns to backup
CONFIG_PATTERNS=(
    "*.json"
    "*.yml"
    "*.yaml"
    "*.env"
    "*.conf"
    "*.txt"
    "*.toml"
)

# Number of backups to keep (default: 10)
BACKUP_RETENTION=10
```

### Restore Script Options

Modify these variables in `restore-configs.sh`:

```bash
# Default backup source
DEFAULT_SOURCE="docs"  # or "config"

# Enable interactive mode by default
DEFAULT_MODE="interactive"  # or "latest"
```

### Hook Configuration

Modify these variables in `.git/hooks/pre-commit`:

```bash
# Config paths to watch
CONFIG_PATHS=(
    "bootstrap/orchestrator-mini/"
    "bootstrap/worker-rtx3060/"
    "bootstrap/worker-rtx3090ti/"
    "bootstrap/worker-rtx5090/"
    ".mcp.json"
    "docker-compose*.yml"
    ".claude-flow/mcp.json"
)
```

